{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"header","type":"text","text":"![[Pasted image 20260723200742.png]]\n\n# Flame Lord Guide\n\n> Elesis 2nd path · Pyro Knight → Blazing Heart → **Flame Lord** 🔥","x":0,"y":0,"width":700,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"dps","type":"text","text":"## DPS & **characteristic**\n\nMid bosser — slightly weaker than other top-tier classes. She's decent at 21-1 ~ 21-4.\n21-5 is not as good as other char because she doesn't quit have a HUGE boss skill.\n\n### High Entropy (End-Game) Perfomance\n\n![[Pasted image 20260723205849.png]]\n\n> BQ > FL ≈ AD >> ES  \n> *Tymes don't directly equal DPS ranking — too many variables (weekly rotation, ![[Pasted image 20260723220308.png|65]] usage, etc.)*","x":0,"y":1100,"width":700,"height":700,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cff69fa51147a71f","type":"file","file":"Elsword/attachments/Pasted image 20260724125251.png","x":-10,"y":423,"width":710,"height":474},
		{"id":"clearing","type":"text","text":"## Clearing\n\n![[Magma.png|65]]\n\nERP queen. Trait for Megabuster: choose **Gigantic**. One Megabuster = POOF.","x":-780,"y":540,"width":700,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"mana","type":"text","text":"## Mana & Coodowns\n\n- **35%+ CDR**  (unless running Blue Exa; normally Red Exa)\n- ![[FL.png|41]] Has ![[Pasted image 20260723214348.png|46]] — recovers **5 MP/sec**\n- Skill MP cost: at least **-15%**, ideally **-30%+** for smooth gameplay","x":800,"y":520,"width":700,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"weaknesses","type":"text","text":"### Weaknesses\n\n1. Even with max CDR, sometimes need extra actions to reset codowns during burst\n2. No extra damage reduction skill — even though she has \"Fire Protection\"","x":0,"y":1880,"width":700,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"build-exa","type":"text","text":"## �️ Exa\n\nCurrently using **Red Exa**\n\n![[Pasted image 20260724090959.png]]\n\nFocusing on exa only","x":-750,"y":2120,"width":400,"height":320,"color":"3"},
